WEBVTT

00:00:29.310 --> 00:00:31.440
What, what is it?

00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:36.610
What's happening? Wow!

00:01:26.870 --> 00:01:30.430
According to experts,
there is a possibility that...

00:01:30.640 --> 00:01:34.230
...adhesives in the building
caused a chemical reaction.

00:01:34.410 --> 00:01:38.740
The investigation continues.
There were three similar incidents...

00:01:38.910 --> 00:01:40.780
...within a 500-meter radius.

00:01:41.320 --> 00:01:45.950
Even so, my Bucho asks me
if I can do it faster.

00:01:46.460 --> 00:01:50.060
He's so irresponsible,
I don't know what to do with him.

00:01:51.660 --> 00:01:56.430
You understand, right? Getting a job
done quickly is not always good.

00:01:56.630 --> 00:01:58.100
That's right.

00:01:58.300 --> 00:02:01.630
I think I can come home early today.

00:02:02.100 --> 00:02:05.000
See you later.

00:02:05.310 --> 00:02:07.370
Have a nice day.

00:02:45.310 --> 00:02:50.950
Shinma are supernatural beings
that devour the hearts of men...

00:02:51.150 --> 00:02:55.380
...and lead them to ruin.

00:02:55.990 --> 00:03:01.390
Long ago, they were sealed
in the Dark World.

00:03:01.600 --> 00:03:05.790
However, there are stray Shinma
that live secretly...

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:08.940
...in the human world.

00:03:09.340 --> 00:03:12.800
They lurk in the division
between night and day.

00:03:13.740 --> 00:03:19.440
The Guardian who sends the stray
Shinma back to the Dark World...

00:03:19.650 --> 00:03:25.140
...is the beautiful vampire, Miyu.

00:03:25.350 --> 00:03:29.260
No one knows her true face.

00:04:01.090 --> 00:04:03.820
SUBWAY

00:04:47.200 --> 00:04:50.070
Sir, we're almost done.

00:04:50.270 --> 00:04:54.170
I'm proud of the accomplishment.
My wife will be pleased, too.

00:04:54.380 --> 00:04:57.810
People say that
your wife is beautiful.

00:04:58.010 --> 00:05:02.970
- I'd love to meet her some day.
- Thanks a lot, but it won't happen!

00:05:30.110 --> 00:05:33.910
- The convenience store just opened.
- It will be really great.

00:05:34.180 --> 00:05:36.880
- Yeah. See you later then.
- Yes, sir.

00:05:58.370 --> 00:06:01.170
TOKIWA SCHOOL

00:06:03.210 --> 00:06:06.270
No matter what happens,
I wouldn't be surprised.

00:06:06.480 --> 00:06:09.080
- What do you mean?
- Sand incidents.

00:06:09.280 --> 00:06:12.250
Ah. Was it the third incident
yesterday?

00:06:12.450 --> 00:06:17.080
A library, a toy store, a convenience
store. There's no consistency.

00:06:17.290 --> 00:06:20.560
Lately, unbelievable
things have been happening.

00:06:20.730 --> 00:06:25.190
- So everyone's feeling a little numb.
- I can sort of relate to that.

00:06:25.400 --> 00:06:29.000
By the way, could you come with me
today after school?

00:06:29.200 --> 00:06:32.230
- I found a cute pair of shoes.
- Okay.

00:06:32.440 --> 00:06:35.030
Miyu, you're going too, right?

00:06:50.760 --> 00:06:55.420
They finally put in a bridge at
the railroad crossing on 3rd street.

00:06:55.630 --> 00:06:58.720
It used to be dangerous there.

00:06:58.930 --> 00:07:04.000
The crossing bars wouldn't close for
a long time. Kids just ignore them.

00:07:27.560 --> 00:07:30.900
Well, another push will do.

00:08:00.400 --> 00:08:04.970
Looking at the progress, it will
take another year or two. Huh?

00:08:11.340 --> 00:08:15.240
Hey, hey, young lady, don't
get on there. It's dangerous.

00:08:15.440 --> 00:08:17.780
Are you building this city?

00:08:17.980 --> 00:08:21.810
Yeah. It's been taking me 30 years.

00:08:22.020 --> 00:08:27.610
- How do you like it? Isn't it nice?
- Yes. It looks comfortable to live in.

00:08:28.590 --> 00:08:31.680
- It must be.
- What's that?

00:08:31.890 --> 00:08:33.420
It was in a temple.

00:08:33.630 --> 00:08:37.760
The decision was made to
tear it down, and I set it on fire.

00:08:43.240 --> 00:08:46.930
Oh, I forgot. I said
I would go home early.

00:08:48.010 --> 00:08:51.000
Young lady, you should
go home early too.

00:09:04.430 --> 00:09:05.950
Shiina.

00:09:06.130 --> 00:09:08.650
I can't find it!
This place is too big!

00:09:09.730 --> 00:09:11.560
How about you, Larva?

00:09:12.030 --> 00:09:14.300
I couldn't find it, either.

00:09:14.500 --> 00:09:17.560
I wonder where the Shinma is hiding.

00:09:17.770 --> 00:09:21.500
You're working hard to do
your duty, Miyu.

00:09:21.710 --> 00:09:23.230
Reiha.

00:09:23.410 --> 00:09:26.440
The way you guys are searching
really irritates me.

00:09:26.650 --> 00:09:30.340
What's taking so long
to find just one Shinma?

00:09:30.550 --> 00:09:32.350
It's nothing new.

00:09:32.550 --> 00:09:34.710
Miyu, just ignore, ignore.

00:09:34.920 --> 00:09:38.190
You can't help it when
you have inferior assistants.

00:09:38.390 --> 00:09:41.260
What? Say that again!

00:09:41.460 --> 00:09:43.930
Stop it, Shiina. Let's go.

00:09:44.170 --> 00:09:49.600
If you have too much trouble,
we don't mind lending a helping hand.

00:09:49.810 --> 00:09:52.370
We don't need it!

00:09:52.570 --> 00:09:54.340
- Shiina.
- Huh?

00:09:54.640 --> 00:09:58.810
I don't consider you my subordinate.

00:09:59.010 --> 00:10:03.950
- Miyu!
- You're so nice to your pet as always.

00:10:04.150 --> 00:10:07.020
It's silly!

00:10:10.330 --> 00:10:12.860
Shoot! These are a little too big!

00:10:13.060 --> 00:10:17.290
Too bad, they don't have
smaller sizes!

00:10:17.770 --> 00:10:19.360
Huh? Where is Miyu?

00:10:19.570 --> 00:10:21.760
Now that you mention it...

00:10:22.370 --> 00:10:26.000
- There she is!
- Miyu, where have you been?

00:10:26.210 --> 00:10:29.770
- Oh, I just heard a sound.
- What? A sound?

00:10:29.980 --> 00:10:34.280
- No, nothing.
- Strange.

00:10:44.530 --> 00:10:46.620
- Darling.
- Huh?

00:10:46.830 --> 00:10:51.290
Do you know of the new railroad
crossing bridge at 3rd Street?

00:10:51.500 --> 00:10:53.930
Yeah, I heard about it.

00:10:54.140 --> 00:10:56.630
I heard it would be useful
for children.

00:10:56.810 --> 00:10:59.910
Is that so? That's necessary.

00:12:44.450 --> 00:12:46.380
Mr. Tachiki?

00:12:46.580 --> 00:12:50.350
No, no, it can't be.

00:12:51.690 --> 00:12:55.780
Could you possibly be Yasuhiko-san?

00:12:55.990 --> 00:12:58.960
You must be. You look
like your father.

00:12:59.160 --> 00:13:01.390
You are Yasuhiko Tachiki, right?

00:13:01.600 --> 00:13:07.060
You survived! Oh, I'm so glad!

00:13:08.770 --> 00:13:10.500
I'm Moriyama...

00:13:10.710 --> 00:13:13.180
...the priest at Rinpuku Temple...

00:13:13.380 --> 00:13:17.450
...the temple where you used to
come to draw paintings.

00:13:19.210 --> 00:13:21.550
Please, stop!

00:13:21.750 --> 00:13:25.050
Wait, Mr. Tachiki.

00:13:29.290 --> 00:13:32.090
Have you remembered, Mr. Tachiki?

00:13:41.900 --> 00:13:45.840
Police! Call the police!

00:13:46.040 --> 00:13:49.030
Wait! Wait, Mr. Tachiki!

00:14:02.360 --> 00:14:04.590
I've just spotted a likely suspect!

00:14:05.130 --> 00:14:07.460
Roger! Take care of the old man.

00:14:07.700 --> 00:14:09.250
- Yes, sir.
- Let's go!

00:14:13.640 --> 00:14:15.440
I found him in stairway A-5!

00:14:18.840 --> 00:14:20.360
This way!

00:14:44.770 --> 00:14:48.220
What? What is this place?

00:14:53.640 --> 00:14:56.040
How come there is
a Buddha statue here?

00:14:56.240 --> 00:14:58.210
Well, I made a mistake.

00:14:58.550 --> 00:15:05.010
Since I wasn't at work this morning,
I might not make the usual progress.

00:15:05.190 --> 00:15:06.710
Hey!

00:15:06.890 --> 00:15:08.650
What is it?

00:15:26.170 --> 00:15:28.200
Call for help!

00:15:34.080 --> 00:15:37.480
There! I need to make up
for the lost time!

00:16:06.350 --> 00:16:08.010
Watch out. Watch out.

00:16:19.130 --> 00:16:24.120
He must have been in love
with the Buddha statue.

00:16:24.600 --> 00:16:29.160
When it was decided to tear down
the temple and move the statue...

00:16:29.370 --> 00:16:33.360
...he set the fire and jumped into it.

00:16:33.580 --> 00:16:36.420
But his body was never found.

00:16:36.610 --> 00:16:40.600
We don't know how he
escaped that fierce fire.

00:16:41.250 --> 00:16:47.020
- Don't buy them. You'll regret it!
- I'll regret it if I don't buy them.

00:16:47.220 --> 00:16:50.420
It's okay. They are just a little big.

00:16:50.630 --> 00:16:55.590
Oh, Miyu didn't come today because she
probably thought it was too boring.

00:17:08.510 --> 00:17:10.100
Unbelievable!

00:17:15.920 --> 00:17:18.410
Now, come on out.

00:17:18.620 --> 00:17:22.080
Shinma must be hiding
somewhere in the vicinity.

00:17:22.290 --> 00:17:25.490
So this is the quickest way.

00:17:39.140 --> 00:17:41.040
Now it has appeared.

00:17:41.510 --> 00:17:44.770
- What, what is it?
- Earthquake?

00:17:49.050 --> 00:17:50.610
I can't believe it!

00:17:55.090 --> 00:17:58.020
It's coming this way!

00:18:01.860 --> 00:18:06.630
I thought nothing would
surprise you anymore, Yukari!

00:18:06.840 --> 00:18:10.910
I take it back! I am freaking out!

00:18:11.210 --> 00:18:13.400
Help!

00:18:21.150 --> 00:18:23.140
Blizzard!

00:19:31.590 --> 00:19:35.390
MOH-CHI

00:19:41.400 --> 00:19:44.260
What a surprise that the Shinma
was a spider.

00:19:44.430 --> 00:19:47.300
You must have met him
in the old temple.

00:19:54.040 --> 00:19:59.270
You were transferring the demolished
buildings and objects into the city...

00:19:59.480 --> 00:20:01.310
...through his delusions.

00:20:01.720 --> 00:20:06.120
But why did you start
targeting new structures?

00:20:46.790 --> 00:20:52.250
I see. That place was intended
to be the nest for her babies.

00:22:12.950 --> 00:22:18.980
The door opens
And before me is eternity

00:22:19.190 --> 00:22:21.520
Whose voice calls me...

00:22:21.720 --> 00:22:25.660
...from so far away?

00:22:25.860 --> 00:22:28.490
Someone smooths down my hair

00:22:28.700 --> 00:22:32.760
Who are you?

00:22:35.440 --> 00:22:39.430
My flute sings of a land
My heart so wishes for

00:22:39.640 --> 00:22:44.270
Where time and my feelings pass by

00:22:44.480 --> 00:22:48.740
- I don't want any friends
- That's a lie.

00:22:48.950 --> 00:22:53.220
- I don't even need myself
- It's the truth.

00:22:53.420 --> 00:22:57.410
Footprints I leave behind

00:22:57.630 --> 00:23:01.900
Washed away

00:23:04.600 --> 00:23:08.690
The night is mysterious
It conceals the truth

00:23:08.900 --> 00:23:13.130
Invited by the moon

00:23:13.340 --> 00:23:17.070
Darkness spreads through the sky

00:23:19.710 --> 00:23:26.210
The night is violet
Tears fall like rain

00:23:26.490 --> 00:23:32.980
The sky cries for me

00:23:40.600 --> 00:23:46.630
The door opens
And before me is eternity

00:23:46.840 --> 00:23:49.170
Whose voice calls me...

00:23:49.380 --> 00:23:53.310
...from so far away?

00:23:53.510 --> 00:23:56.140
Someone smooths down my hair

00:23:56.350 --> 00:24:00.410
Who are you?

00:24:03.090 --> 00:24:07.080
My flute sings of a land
My heart so wishes for

00:24:07.300 --> 00:24:11.930
Where time and my feelings pass by

00:24:12.130 --> 00:24:16.400
- I don't want any friends
- That's a lie.

00:24:16.600 --> 00:24:20.870
- I don't even need myself
- It's the truth.

00:24:21.080 --> 00:24:25.080
Footprints I leave behind

00:24:25.280 --> 00:24:29.540
Washed away

00:24:32.250 --> 00:24:36.350
The night is mysterious
It conceals the truth

00:24:36.560 --> 00:24:40.790
Invited by the moon

00:24:41.000 --> 00:24:44.740
Darkness spreads through the sky

00:24:47.370 --> 00:24:53.860
The night is violet
Tears fall like rain

00:24:54.140 --> 00:25:00.640
The sky cries for me

00:25:06.290 --> 00:25:08.480
A woman loves only a doll.

00:25:08.690 --> 00:25:14.630
Eventually, the love wins over
the doll, and they are happy.

00:25:14.830 --> 00:25:20.160
But when another young woman
enters the scene...

00:25:20.370 --> 00:25:24.130
...their quiet life is shattered.

00:25:24.340 --> 00:25:26.640
Next on Vampire Princess Miyu:

00:25:26.840 --> 00:25:28.900
"Love of the Dolls"

00:25:29.110 --> 00:25:32.240
A terrifying end for a love story.
